# godspeed/game and debris/game are Node/Vite builds - the image builds
# them fresh inside their own node:22-alpine stages via `npm ci`; a
# locally-built node_modules (wrong platform binaries) or a stale local
# dist/ must never leak into those COPYs.
**/node_modules
godspeed/game/dist
debris/game/dist
